# PlanQ CLI

PlanQ is a Git-native planning DSL, validator, formatter, and read-only Gantt
tool.

This npm package supports Linux glibc x86_64 and requires Node.js 20 or newer.
Use [Homebrew on macOS arm64](https://planq.dev/docs/install) or
[winget on Windows x86_64](https://planq.dev/docs/install).

## Install

```bash
npm install --global @planq-cli/planq@@@VERSION@@
planq version
```

Run without a global install:

```bash
npx @planq-cli/planq@@@VERSION@@ version
```

## Quickstart

```bash
planq init project.plan --id demo --name "Demo"
planq validate project.plan
planq dev project.plan
```

Continue with the
[five-minute Quickstart](https://planq.dev/docs/quickstart) or review
[installation and supported platforms](https://planq.dev/docs/install).

Do not install with `--no-optional`; the wrapper requires the exact matching
`@planq-cli/linux-x64` package. Linux musl/Alpine, Linux arm64, macOS, and
Windows are not supported by this npm package.

